  "description": "The Jupiter X1 Mini/Max features a 72V high-voltage system for powerful performance and extended range. Its 2000W-rated motor (up to 5000W peak) delivers 185Nm torque, effortlessly climbing hills with a top speed up to 50mph on Jupiter X1 Mini and 55mph on Jupiter X1 Max. The reinforced full-aluminum frame with upgraded key areas ensures strength and durability. Front dual-crown fork and DNM adjustable rear shock, along with an adjustable stem handlebar, offer comfort on long rides. Powered by a 72V 30Ah single battery (Samsung High-Discharge Large-Capacity Cells), it achieves up to 90 miles of range (Battery range test conditions: Rider height 5'9\", weight 154 lbs, PAS level 3 (no throttle), flat road, temperature 68–77°F.). Four-piston hydraulic brakes, full lighting system, oversized color display, and fat tires (Mini 20''x4'', Max 26''x4'') maximize safety, control, and style.",
